      "complete_actual_head": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards — Alec Kriebel</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"An exact least-period criterion classifies when ordinary focal-distance products are constant in noncircular elliptic billiards, including primitive windings and repetitions.\"><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Alec Kriebel\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\"><meta name=\"citation_title\" content=\"An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards\"><meta name=\"citation_author\" content=\"Alec Kriebel\"><meta name=\"citation_author_orcid\" content=\"https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9320-500X\"><meta name=\"citation_publication_date\" content=\"2026/10/11\"><meta name=\"citation_version\" content=\"1.0.0\"><meta name=\"citation_doi\" content=\"10.5281/zenodo.23306203\"><meta name=\"citation_pdf_url\" content=\"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23306203/files/focal_product_period_criterion.pdf/content\"><meta name=\"citation_language\" content=\"en\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"ScholarlyArticle\", \"name\": \"An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards\", \"headline\": \"An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards\", \"description\": \"An exact least-period criterion classifies when ordinary focal-distance products are constant in noncircular elliptic billiards, including primitive windings and repetitions.\", \"abstract\": \"For a noncircular elliptic billiard with a strictly nested nondegenerate confocal elliptical caustic, we prove that the product of ordinary distances from all vertices to either fixed focus is independent of phase if and only if the least period is 2 modulo 4. This proves the least-period interpretation of entry k₁₁₄ in Reznik–Garcia–Koiller's list of unproved invariants and classifies every other primitive period and every repeated traversal. The proof identifies the complete divisor of the focal-distance factor in the classical Jacobi parameter. An exact doubled-triangle example shows why a condition on return length alone is insufficient. The parametrization, identities and divisor method are established tools. This AI-assisted research note is unrefereed.\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"name\": \"Alec Kriebel\", \"identifier\": \"https://orcid.org/0009-0001-9320-500X\"}, \"datePublished\": \"2026-10-11\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\", \"identifier\": \"10.5281/zenodo.23306203\", \"url\": \"https://aleckriebel.com/research/focal-distance-period-criterion/\", \"creativeWorkStatus\": \"Unrefereed preprint\", \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\", \"inLanguage\": \"en\", \"encoding\": [{\"@type\": \"MediaObject\", \"encodingFormat\": \"application/zip\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23306203/files/focal_product_support.zip/content\", \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\"}, {\"@type\": \"MediaObject\", \"encodingFormat\": \"application/pdf\", \"contentUrl\": \"https://zenodo.org/api/records/23306203/files/focal_product_period_criterion.pdf/content\", \"license\": \"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\"}], \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"@id\": \"https://aleckriebel.com/research/focal-distance-period-criterion/\"}}</script><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#111;max-width:1050px;margin:2rem auto;padding:0 1.25rem;line-height:1.6}h1{line-height:1.2}h2{margin-top:2rem}a{color:#0645ad}p,li{overflow-wrap:anywhere}details{margin:1.5rem 0}summary{cursor:pointer}.paper-pdf{display:block;width:100%;height:80vh;min-height:500px;max-height:1000px;border:1px solid #ccc;box-sizing:border-box}</style><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://aleckriebel.com/research/focal-distance-period-criterion/\"><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An exact least-period criterion classifies when ordinary focal-distance products are constant in noncircular elliptic billiards, including primitive windings and repetitions.\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://aleckriebel.com/research/focal-distance-period-criterion/\"><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alec Kriebel\"><meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-10-11\"><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"An exact period criterion for focal-distance products in elliptic billiards\"><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"An exact least-period criterion classifies when ordinary focal-distance products are constant in noncircular elliptic billiards, including primitive windings and repetitions.\"></head><body>\n<a href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n",
